{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539970/extras/txt-steam.png?t=1741283024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a friendly and minimalist dungeon crawler experience where the player choose an adventurer who will try to discover the secret of an ancient tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chill ?</strong> In this fast paced turn by turn rogue like, the rules are simple. Move your card on another one when you are ready and try to reach the next floor !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Danger ?</strong> You will face monsters and traps so take care or you will die :(</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One more try ?</strong> Each run will be different with the random spawning card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No time for long story ?</strong> the game clearly focus on gameplay with a minimalist story / lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For all ?</strong> No violence in Super Smling Dungeon : all monsters are smiling and now...you understand the title of the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features :</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special unique skill by hero\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 60 differents enemis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 in game achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorial : game mechanics can be learned in less than 5 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Languages : English / French</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro design with mainly black &amp; white colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\